---
description: Rules for the database schema and migrations
globs: prisma/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- `schema.prisma` is the contract; every change ships as a migration (`pnpm prisma migrate dev --name <name>`).
- Domain enums are Prisma enums. Name models and fields in the client's business terms.
- Never edit generated output in `src/generated/`; run `pnpm prisma generate`.
